@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### Health
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### Categories (deprecated v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/categories

### Search and filter events
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events?q=robotics&category=Engineering

### Event detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/1

### Create an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Campus API Demo",
  "description": "A hands-on REST API workshop.",
  "category": "Technology",
  "startsAt": "2027-01-10T18:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-01-10T20:00:00.000Z",
  "location": "Online",
  "capacity": 40,
  "meetingUrl": "https://events.mcgill.ca/meet/api-demo"
}

### RSVP
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/1/rsvps
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@mcgill.ca"
}

### Cancel RSVP
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/1/rsvps/student%40mcgill.ca

### V2 event list (structured location)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/events?q=AI%20Ethics
